<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97745" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκατ-εργάζομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>help</i> or <i>assist</i> any
			one <i>in achieving</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ Κύρῳ τὴν βασιληΐην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.162
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				33
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πᾶν ξ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.132
			</span></i>: c. dat. only, <i>aid, assist</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.154
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.142
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>help to conquer</i> a country, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pyrrh.</u>
				18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>join in murdering</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				1024
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
